OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry
OL,6,Fconditions, light winds and prolonged
OL,7,Fclear spells for much of the night
OL,8,Fwill allow for some mist and fog
OL,9,Fpatches to form. Turning cold, with a
OL,10,Fwidespread frost developing. Becoming
OL,11,Fbreezy towards dawn with cloud
OL,12,Fbuilding from the west. Minimum
OL,13,FTemperature -2C.
OL,14,
OL,15,CWednesday:FTurning windy and unsettled
OL,16,Fthrough Wednesday, with cloudy skies
OL,17,Fand outbreaks of rain arriving. Some
OL,18,Fpersistent and heavy rain likely. Rain
OL,19,Fclearing overnight with winds easing.
OL,20,FMaximum Temperature 9C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
