OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FThursday and Friday brighter with
OL,7,Fshowers and chance of some rain.
OL,8,FBreezier by Friday. Saturday cloudier
OL,9,Fwith rain probably arriving later, and
OL,10,Faccompanied by strengthening winds.
OL,11,FTemperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
